<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia SEA Corp 1996 net up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia SEA Corp 1996 net up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    26.63   vs	  22.18</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	   22.6    vs	  18.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		     345.87   vs	 203.59</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		41.55   vs	  34.81</p>
<p>    Minorities	    less   1.17   vs  less   0.65</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)	 10.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is South East Asia Development Corp Bhd. It is involved in property letting and financial-related activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
